een shirt with “WORRY LESS CHILL MORE” — matches the criterion.\n- **This is a market visit + talking to a boy in green shirt.**\n\n#### Frames 15–24:\n- Vlogger is **walking through the same market area**, under striped tents, with stalls on one side and greenery on the other.\n- He is **not in a forest** — it’s a roadside market with trees nearby, but not a forest walk.\n- **No zoo is visible** — no animals, enclosures, or signage suggesting a zoo.\n- He is **still in the market**, not transitioning to a forest or zoo.\n\n#### Frame 25:\n- Wide shot of the **white and red building** (dzong/monastery) — the destination.\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Evaluate Answer Choice 2\n\n> *He walks in the forest, visits a local market, visits the zoo, and talks to a boy in green shirt in the zoo*\n\n- ✅ **Visits a local market** — YES (Frames 1–24)\n- ✅ **Talks to a boy in green shirt** — YES (Frames 1–14)\n- ❌ **Walks in the forest** — NO. He walks *alongside* a market with trees, but not *in a forest*. The environment is semi-urban/rural market, not forested trail.\n- ❌ **Visits the zoo** — NO. There is no evidence of a zoo in any frame. No animals, cages, or zoo signage.\n\n→ **Two critical components of answer 2 are false.**\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\n**Answer '2' is incorrect** because:\n- The vlogger does **not walk in a forest**.\n- The vlogger does **not visit a zoo**.\n- The interaction with the boy in green happens **in the market**, **not in a zoo**.\n\n---\n\n✅ **Final Answer: NO, answer '2' is not correct.**"}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 66, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/USfvmoalqsw/frames/frame_4894.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/USfvmoalqsw/frames/frame_4895.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/USfvmoalqsw/frames/frame_4896.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/USfvmoalqsw/frames/frame_4897.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/USfvmoalqsw/frames/frame_4898.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_pr